        "publicTransport": "<p>The <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/news/2025/snowy-mountains-bus-service\" target=\"_blank\">Snowy Mountains Bus Service</a> will run from Jindabyne to Perisher or Thredbo and return every day during ski season from 7 June to 5 October 2025. <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/news/2025/snowy-mountains-bus-service\" target=\"_blank\">Book Here</a></p><p><br></p>",
